From 2ddb9bf2707898ea9ad435f7096f64ad36942f42 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Z User <z@container>
Date: Sat, 9 May 2026 16:34:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: resolve all 15 security and code quality issues

CRITICAL fixes:
- CORS: Removed wildcard override middleware, using cors library whitelist only
- Credentials: Replaced exposed DB credentials with placeholders in .env
- JWT: Replaced weak hardcoded secret with placeholder requiring cryptographically random value
- WebSocket: Added JWT authentication middleware to Socket.IO connections
- Rate Limiting: Added express-rate-limit for global (100/15min), login (10/15min), register (5/hr)

HIGH fixes:
- Role-based access control: Added roleCheck middleware to all protected endpoints
- Chat identity: Server now uses JWT-verified userId instead of client-provided senderId
- Hardcoded URLs: Replaced localhost URLs with centralized api service using env variables
- JWT expiry: Reduced to 15min access tokens + 7d refresh tokens with refresh endpoint
- Token blacklisting: Added logout with token revocation

MEDIUM fixes:
- Duplicate files: Removed stale pages/ directory with 10 duplicate component files
- Error sanitization: Added global error handler hiding details in production
- Error leakage: Removed error.message from 27 API response catch blocks across 6 route files
- nodemon: Moved from dependencies to devDependencies in package.json
- CSP: Tightened Content-Security-Policy in index.html
- .gitignore: Added .env files, *.log, uploads/, node_modules/ patterns
- server.log: Removed file containing leaked database credentials
